      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹109 (vs ₹104 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹109 (up from ₹104 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹426.6m (up 9.8% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹142.3m (up 5.0% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 33% (down from 35% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 48% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
